rule word_of_another_type v1
description "The most a penalty can be, and what it is counted by. A word in an answer column is read in the column's type: `violation` below is the value of counted_by, though an input of another type is named violation too"

enum violation_kind = willful | serious | posting
enum counted_by = violation | day

inputs
  violation : violation_kind

outputs
  most : money[USD]  round down(1USD)
  per  : counted_by

table caps
policy unique
| violation | -> most | per       |
| willful   | 165514USD | violation |
| serious   | 16550USD  | violation |
| posting   | 16550USD  | day       |

examples
| violation | -> most   | per       |
| willful   | 165514USD | violation |
| posting   | 16550USD  | day       |
